usage: aiwork native [-h] {run,grade,rea-select} ...

positional arguments:
  {run,grade,rea-select}
    run                 run a configurable native development campaign
    grade               compare a frozen candidate against unseen inputs
    rea-select          score exported REA-Next rounds on a native public
                        corpus

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
